$DATUM Ethyl 2-[7-(2-aminophenylthio)-5,6,8-trifluoro-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-
4-oxo-1,4-dihydrocinnolin-3-yl}-(2-mercaptophenylimino) glyoxylate (7). A
solution of cinnolone 1a (0.270 g, 0.64 mmol) and o-aminobenzenethiol
(0.137 mL, 1.28 mmol) in MeOH (7 mL) was refluxed for 4 h and then cooled
to -20 °C. After recrystallization from MeOH, compound 7 was obtained in
a yield of 0.302 g (see Tables 1 and 2). C31H23F3N4O4S2; IR, ν/cm-1:
3450, 3350 (NH); 1730 (COOEt), 1620 (C=O); 1570, 1500, 1480 (C=N, C=C);
NMR spectrum, (DMSO-d6, δ, J/Hz): 1H: 1.12 (t. 3 H, OCH2CH3, J = 7.0);
3.83 (s, 3 H, OCH3); 5.38 (br.s, 2 H, NH2); 4.14 (q, 2 H, OCH2CH3, J =
7.0); 6.43-7.53 (m. 13 H, 3 C6H4, SH); 19F: 16.33 (dd, 1F, F(5)); 25.67
(d, 1F, F(6)); 53.78 (d, 1F, F(8)); J 5,8 = J 8,5 = 17.2; J 5,6 = J 6,5 =
21.5; J 6,8 = J 8,6 = 0
